1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,106
Quick recap.

2
00:00:01,106 --> 00:00:06,679
Polar form is length and angle, with the angle taken from the plotted quadrant.

3
00:00:06,679 --> 00:00:10,494
Multiplying multiplies lengths and adds angles.

4
00:00:10,494 --> 00:00:13,229
De Moivre raises both to the n.

5
00:00:13,229 --> 00:00:18,242
The n th roots sit on a regular polygon and add to zero.

6
00:00:18,242 --> 00:00:21,953
One plus omega plus omega squared is zero.

7
00:00:21,953 --> 00:00:29,075
And Euler's formula says e to the i theta is cos theta plus i sin theta.

